        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur business is you..\r\n\r\n6 Bedroom, 3 Bathroom Detached Family Home \r\nOffice, Outbuildings, and Conservatory.\r\nMost Sought-After Location \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present Seacrest to the Rush Co Dublin property market. \r\nNestled on the ever-popular and highly sought-after South Shore Road, Seacrest is an outstanding detached family home occupying a magnificent private site with beautifully maintained wraparound gardens. Rarely does a property of this scale, quality and location come to the market, offering the perfect blend of spacious family accommodation and an unrivalled coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nApproached via a long private driveway with ample off-street parking for numerous vehicles, the property immediately impresses with its mature surroundings and sense of privacy. A welcoming entrance porch leads into the home, with a practical boot room/storage area conveniently located to the left.\r\n\r\nThe bright and spacious entrance hallway sets the tone for the generous accommodation throughout. To the right is an elegant front living room featuring a beautiful fireplace and multiple windows overlooking the mature front gardens, flooding the room with natural light. Double doors open into the formal dining room, an ideal space for entertaining while enjoying picturesque views over the side and rear gardens.\r\n\r\nThe dining room flows seamlessly into the spacious open-plan kitchen, which offers an abundance of fitted base and eye-level units, generous worktop space and an excellent layout for modern family living. Off the kitchen is a separate utility room/scullery with direct access to the rear garden, providing excellent additional storage and practicality.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor continues to impress with three generous double bedrooms, one of which benefits from a private en-suite. A large family bathroom, fitted with quality sanitary ware, serves the remaining bedrooms. One of the bedrooms provides excellent flexibility and could be used as a family room and has a wood burner, playroom, sixth bedroom depending on individual requirements. Every room enjoys large windows overlooking the surrounding gardens, creating bright and inviting living spaces throughout.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a spacious landing , and storage which leads to a further three double bedrooms. The impressive principal suite is exceptionally large, offering ample space for a private lounge or dressing area while also benefiting from a well-appointed en-suite bathroom. Completing the first floor is a dedicated home office and a substantial additional living area, creating the perfect retreat for growing families, teenagers or those working remotely. Two of the bedrooms feature Velux windows which enhance the natural light and sense of space.\r\n\r\nThe property has been lovingly maintained by its current owners, with the high standard of care evident throughout every aspect of the home.\r\n\r\nOutside, the grounds are equally impressive. Beautiful wraparound gardens provide exceptional privacy and include a productive vegetable garden , greenhouse ,together with a separate conservatory/sunroom, creating the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing during long summer evenings. A detached block-built garage offers excellent storage or presents superb potential for conversion into a workshop, studio, gym or home office (subject to the necessary planning permission). A separate garden shed provides additional practical storage.\r\n\r\nSituated just moments from the beautiful South Beach, Seacrest enjoys one of the finest residential locations in Rush. The renowned Rush Golf Club is only a short stroll away, while the picturesque coastline offers excellent opportunities for swimming, sailing, paddleboarding, fishing and scenic coastal walks.\r\n\r\nRush is a vibrant and welcoming seaside town with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, boutiques, primary and secondary schools, sports clubs and recreational amenities, all within walking distance of the property.\r\n\r\nCommuters are exceptionally well catered for, with Rush & Lusk Railway Station providing regular services to Dublin City Centre, while Dublin Bus offers excellent public transport links. The M1 and M50 motorways, Dublin Airport, Swords and the M50 are all easily accessible, making this an ideal location for those travelling throughout Dublin and beyond. The neighbouring coastal town of Skerries, with its award-winning beaches, marina, restaurants and cafés, is only a short drive away.\r\n\r\nSeacrest represents a truly exceptional opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in one of North County Dublin's most prestigious coastal addresses. Combining generous accommodation, beautifully maintained gardens, outstanding privacy and an unbeatable seaside location, this is a home that will appeal to discerning purchasers seeking an exceptional lifestyle in the heart of Rush.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
